WEBVTT

00:00:00.210 --> 00:00:03.330
You the so-called "Crazy Person"?

00:00:03.460 --> 00:00:07.080
Indeed. I am Fujiko Taito.

00:00:07.080 --> 00:00:11.710
If I can win this duel, I can get all of Ryuuou's slaves.

00:00:11.710 --> 00:00:15.290
I don't know where he is,
but move forward and take the flag!

00:00:15.500 --> 00:00:19.750
It's pretty ironic that you're losing
the moment you thought you'd won, isn't it?

00:00:20.670 --> 00:00:21.380
This is your punishment.

00:00:22.960 --> 00:00:25.210
You tried to take my slaves from me.

00:00:25.960 --> 00:00:28.960
That's why I wanted to punish you.

00:00:32.130 --> 00:00:33.420
I lose.

00:00:35.040 --> 00:00:45.330
Itsuwari mo naku waraeru you na kokoro ga hoshii

00:00:50.790 --> 00:00:57.000
Hajime kara nani mo nozomanakerya

00:00:58.290 --> 00:01:04.750
Kono kokoro shizumu koto nai no kana

00:01:05.500 --> 00:01:13.630
Aisareru yorokobi nara shitteiru kedo

00:01:13.630 --> 00:01:22.210
Monotarinai mitasarenai nayami wa tsukinai

00:01:24.170 --> 00:01:28.170
Karakara na kokoro uruoshite kureyo

00:01:28.170 --> 00:01:31.960
Afureru hodo yu wo sosoide kure

00:01:31.960 --> 00:01:37.500
Munashiku tada hibiku kono sakebigoe

00:01:39.750 --> 00:01:43.750
Taikutsu de arifureteiru mainichi demo

00:01:43.750 --> 00:01:47.420
Kono mi ni ataerareta koufuku da to

00:01:47.420 --> 00:01:59.880
Itsuwari mo naku waraeru you na kokoro ga hoshii

00:02:06.920 --> 00:02:10.880
-discovery-

00:02:08.630 --> 00:02:10.880
Our little "family" has gotten pretty big.

00:02:11.380 --> 00:02:13.920
I'm Fujiko Taito.

00:02:13.920 --> 00:02:17.790
I'm a nurse, specializing in injections. Let's all get along.

00:02:18.000 --> 00:02:20.580
Get along, my ass, you phony nurse!

00:02:20.790 --> 00:02:25.460
This bitch came into my hospital room,
drugged me, then carried me away!

00:02:26.040 --> 00:02:29.380
My goodness, Zenichi-san,
you should watch your language.

00:02:29.380 --> 00:02:31.830
The hell?! I ain't your slave anymore, ya know!

00:02:31.830 --> 00:02:32.630
Shut up.

00:02:33.000 --> 00:02:35.250
Chuo, talk.

00:02:35.920 --> 00:02:37.460
Yeah, I got it.

00:02:39.170 --> 00:02:40.500
Let's get to business.

00:02:40.500 --> 00:02:44.130
Does anyone here know
the person with the star-symbol SCM?

00:02:44.130 --> 00:02:45.630
Star symbol?

00:02:45.880 --> 00:02:46.960
Yeah.

00:02:47.130 --> 00:02:49.880
Usually, when people are displayed on this map,

00:02:49.970 --> 00:02:55.880
Master
Slave
New User

00:02:50.170 --> 00:02:55.250
Masters are circles, Slaves are triangles,
and new users are squares.

00:02:55.380 --> 00:02:59.380
But in the last few days,
a star mark's been showing up on the map.

00:02:59.830 --> 00:03:02.880
Right now, we don't know what that means.

00:03:03.170 --> 00:03:06.420
But if he's wearing an SCM, I'm going to enslave him.

00:03:06.630 --> 00:03:08.080
...and that's his command.

00:03:08.080 --> 00:03:12.170
Whoever he is, he could pose a threat to us.

00:03:12.540 --> 00:03:14.420
We should take him out as soon as possible.

00:03:15.830 --> 00:03:20.330
The star-symbol SCM
showed up inside a school in the city.

00:03:20.750 --> 00:03:23.420
We don't know who he is,

00:03:23.420 --> 00:03:26.540
so first we've got to get some information
that could give us a hint.

00:03:26.960 --> 00:03:27.750
That means, Julia...

00:03:28.710 --> 00:03:29.500
Yes?

00:03:29.630 --> 00:03:31.920
You're going to infiltrate that school.

00:03:32.540 --> 00:03:33.880
Infiltrate...?

00:03:34.080 --> 00:03:34.960
Julia.

00:03:37.790 --> 00:03:38.960
I'll do it!

00:03:39.250 --> 00:03:41.380
I've got a uniform for you here.

00:03:41.960 --> 00:03:44.790
Get as much information as you can
about that star SCM user.

00:03:44.790 --> 00:03:45.460
Right!

00:03:46.420 --> 00:03:48.330
Are you feeling well enough to do this?

00:03:48.540 --> 00:03:52.170
Yes. Besides, it's an order from Master Ryuuou...

00:03:53.630 --> 00:03:57.540
Would it be alright if I volunteered as well?

00:03:57.540 --> 00:03:59.040
Volunteered? You...?

00:03:59.460 --> 00:04:02.210
I... don't think you can. You don't have a uniform.

00:04:02.670 --> 00:04:04.790
Oh, I'm sorry, but I won't need one.

00:04:04.790 --> 00:04:06.330
I've got another idea.

00:04:19.080 --> 00:04:23.290
It's been so long since I've gone to school.
This really takes me back...

00:04:26.920 --> 00:04:28.170
Looking for someone?

00:04:29.880 --> 00:04:31.920
U-umm...

00:04:32.210 --> 00:04:33.500
Huh? You know her?

00:04:33.500 --> 00:04:35.920
No, I don't. We've never met.

00:04:36.040 --> 00:04:37.000
What class are you in?

00:04:37.000 --> 00:04:38.380
You're an upperclassman, right?

00:04:39.630 --> 00:04:42.420
U-umm, well, you see...

00:04:42.630 --> 00:04:44.380
No way, you got hurt and were in the hospital?

00:04:44.380 --> 00:04:46.670
Yeah, that's why I couldn't come to school.

00:04:46.790 --> 00:04:48.210
Not even to the opening ceremony?

00:04:48.500 --> 00:04:51.290
Wait, so does that mean we're your first friends here?

00:04:51.290 --> 00:04:52.210
That's so crazy!

00:04:52.210 --> 00:04:54.040
Hey, gimme your phone number!

00:04:54.040 --> 00:04:56.380
Sorry, I don't have a smartphone...

00:04:56.540 --> 00:04:58.380
No way, your parents are so strict!

00:04:58.380 --> 00:05:01.290
Hey, I heard someone talking about something earlier...

00:05:01.290 --> 00:05:03.380
Do you know what an SCM is?

00:05:03.630 --> 00:05:05.670
Huh? S and M?

00:05:06.170 --> 00:05:08.290
Isn't it kind of early in the day to be talking about that?

00:05:08.290 --> 00:05:09.880
Jeez!

00:05:10.500 --> 00:05:12.000
That's not what I meant!

00:05:12.990 --> 00:05:14.490
Nurse's
Office

00:05:17.580 --> 00:05:20.130
I wouldn't have figured you had the credentials
to be a health teacher.

00:05:20.130 --> 00:05:23.880
I've always wanted to work at a place
where I could wear a white lab coat.

00:05:24.460 --> 00:05:25.960
It's kinda sexy, don't you think?

00:05:26.080 --> 00:05:27.330
It's not my thing.

00:05:28.040 --> 00:05:30.380
In any case, I've got a list of names.

00:05:30.380 --> 00:05:34.080
Though none of them have a star mark by them.

00:05:34.790 --> 00:05:36.420
Shouldn't you be a little more concerned?

00:05:36.630 --> 00:05:37.630
It's fine.

00:05:37.630 --> 00:05:40.420
The real teacher's on an extended leave
due to "sudden illness", after all.

00:05:40.420 --> 00:05:41.630
Well, isn't that awful.

00:05:41.830 --> 00:05:45.420
Don't worry, I've got my pharmaceutical license, too...

00:05:47.670 --> 00:05:48.630
Come in.

00:05:48.630 --> 00:05:50.130
Excuse me, ma'am...

00:05:50.420 --> 00:05:52.710
Is everything alright? Mister, ah...

00:05:52.830 --> 00:05:55.170
Setagaya. Where's the nurse?

00:05:55.540 --> 00:05:58.500
Ueno-sensei isn't feeling well.

00:05:58.670 --> 00:06:00.250
Well, isn't that...

00:06:00.460 --> 00:06:02.250
...fortunate.

00:06:03.830 --> 00:06:04.250
Fujiko Taito
I asked the students about
SCMs and nobody knew
what they were

00:06:04.290 --> 00:06:08.330
Fujiko Taito
I asked the students about
SCMs and nobody knew
what they were

00:06:05.250 --> 00:06:08.250
Nobody here's heard of an SCM...

00:06:10.040 --> 00:06:12.540
Fujiko Taito
I asked the students about
SCMs and nobody knew
what they were
Found someone who has an
SCM. Come to the bio lab
on the 3rd floor. Hurry.

00:06:26.310 --> 00:06:27.730
Permian
MASS EXTINCTIONS
Carboniferous
Devonian
Silurian
Ordovician
Cambrian

00:06:30.380 --> 00:06:32.000
Hey, there she is.

00:06:37.460 --> 00:06:39.790
Your name's Julia, right?

00:06:44.380 --> 00:06:46.130
Well, c'mon, let's do it!

00:06:48.080 --> 00:06:48.630
Huh?

00:06:48.630 --> 00:06:51.880
What the hell, you're not even wearing it!

00:06:52.040 --> 00:06:54.380
Go get it so we can duel!

00:06:54.580 --> 00:06:56.880
Now, now, calm down, there.

00:06:57.750 --> 00:07:00.670
I'm Tsubaki Setagaya.

00:07:00.670 --> 00:07:03.380
This is my assistant, Minami Kita.

00:07:04.790 --> 00:07:10.380
I've been meaning to have a nice, long chat with you,
Julia Katsushika-san.

00:07:10.750 --> 00:07:12.630
What...?

00:07:12.880 --> 00:07:17.170
Of course, I mean both you and your master.

00:07:21.080 --> 00:07:22.330
Fujiko-san!

00:07:23.420 --> 00:07:25.420
We've got to tell Chuo-san and the others!

00:07:25.420 --> 00:07:26.580
You can't.

00:07:27.500 --> 00:07:30.750
Fujiko-sensei has already become my slave.

00:07:32.920 --> 00:07:34.000
Sorry...

00:07:37.000 --> 00:07:39.170
Master Ryuuou...

00:07:48.130 --> 00:07:51.710
How are you feeling, Julia Katsushika-san?

00:07:57.130 --> 00:08:01.960
Please cooperate with me. I don't want you to get hurt.

00:08:01.960 --> 00:08:04.960
You are a precious sample, after all.

00:08:04.960 --> 00:08:06.830
Please, tell me.

00:08:06.830 --> 00:08:09.670
How does it feel to be a slave?

00:08:09.670 --> 00:08:12.830
To devote your all to your master?

00:08:13.420 --> 00:08:16.460
Explain it to me so a free man
like myself can understand.

00:08:17.790 --> 00:08:20.460
There are two kinds of people in this world.

00:08:20.580 --> 00:08:24.880
Those who lead and those who follow.

00:08:25.460 --> 00:08:28.460
I cannot help but take pity on them.

00:08:28.670 --> 00:08:33.670
People cling to false hopes of freedom and equality.

00:08:33.670 --> 00:08:37.330
If those people knew from the start
that they were the kind to be traded and stolen,

00:08:37.330 --> 00:08:40.460
they could avoid so much pain...

00:08:41.210 --> 00:08:45.170
I want to lead humanity down a better path!

00:08:45.380 --> 00:08:49.040
And the SCM is the tool that will help me accomplish it!

00:08:49.330 --> 00:08:51.540
You made the SCMs?

00:08:52.830 --> 00:08:57.790
Katsushika-san, don't you want to know
about the SCM with the star symbol?

00:09:00.000 --> 00:09:03.500
There's only one of them in the world.
A special kind of SCM.

00:09:03.500 --> 00:09:06.290
It's called the Judgement SCM.

00:09:06.420 --> 00:09:09.420
Let me show you its power.

00:09:10.750 --> 00:09:14.290
Here's your SCM. Open your mouth.

00:09:26.040 --> 00:09:29.880
My, my, whatever will you do if you break your SCM?

00:09:30.960 --> 00:09:35.790
Once you become a slave,
you cannot live without your SCM.

00:09:36.080 --> 00:09:39.710
You'll start to experience withdrawal
and eventually go insane.

00:09:40.460 --> 00:09:42.170
I've got it.

00:09:42.290 --> 00:09:43.960
Since this is such a great opportunity,

00:09:44.080 --> 00:09:49.460
why don't we see how long someone can resist
their desire to wear their SCM?!

00:09:51.830 --> 00:09:58.080
If this man enslaves me, I'll be Master Ryuuou's enemy...

00:09:58.460 --> 00:10:01.130
I'd rather die!

00:10:02.540 --> 00:10:06.130
Okay, Eia, what're we doing now?

00:10:06.540 --> 00:10:08.880
We're going to duel the man Sachi-san told us about.

00:10:09.080 --> 00:10:10.540
Muon Nerima, huh?

00:10:10.540 --> 00:10:11.880
He's gonna be a real pain.

00:10:11.880 --> 00:10:15.630
I know, but that's why we've got to
get him on our side as soon as possible.

00:10:15.790 --> 00:10:17.630
You got a plan?

00:10:17.630 --> 00:10:19.880
Of course. Wanna hear?

00:10:20.130 --> 00:10:21.790
Yes, please!

00:10:24.090 --> 00:10:26.840
Takio Minato

00:10:33.130 --> 00:10:34.750
Dammit. That fuckin' bitch...

00:10:39.000 --> 00:10:39.750
Ow...

00:10:41.790 --> 00:10:44.000
Sorry there. You alright?

00:10:44.250 --> 00:10:45.540
You dropped something...

00:10:46.210 --> 00:10:46.880
Don't touch that!

00:10:47.710 --> 00:10:48.790
Hey!

00:10:48.790 --> 00:10:51.500
Fuck, fuck, fuck!

00:10:51.670 --> 00:10:53.290
Fuck, fuck, fuck, fuck, fuck!

00:10:53.290 --> 00:10:56.130
Every fucking one of them looks down on me!

00:11:07.250 --> 00:11:08.790
Fuckin' Tsubaki...!

00:11:09.380 --> 00:11:11.830
I wanted to make Julia my slave...

00:11:11.830 --> 00:11:14.540
He's not even a master! Why's he going after her?

00:11:14.790 --> 00:11:18.000
Now, now, don't go doing anything risky.

00:11:18.250 --> 00:11:21.000
It's different from making me your slave.

00:11:21.000 --> 00:11:22.540
Shut it, you old bastard!

00:11:22.540 --> 00:11:23.630
Shut your damn mouth!

00:11:26.830 --> 00:11:28.130
You were so damn overprotective!

00:11:28.920 --> 00:11:33.000
When I was in elementary school,
another kid hurt me in a fight.

00:11:33.670 --> 00:11:36.080
It was just a little fight... that was all.

00:11:36.160 --> 00:11:40.660
FOR
SALE

00:11:36.670 --> 00:11:40.290
But soon after, that kid and her family moved away.

00:11:41.540 --> 00:11:44.920
In middle school, I tangled with a gang of delinquents.

00:11:46.250 --> 00:11:49.080
Soon after that, they all suffered terrible injuries
and started to behave.

00:11:49.580 --> 00:11:52.290
In high school, even when
I tried to go out on the town at night,

00:11:52.630 --> 00:11:56.130
everyone who tried to approach me disappeared.

00:11:58.670 --> 00:12:00.670
Just stop it already, you old bastard!

00:12:02.750 --> 00:12:03.830
What are you talking about?

00:12:04.500 --> 00:12:07.080
Those were all coincidences, really! Coincidences!

00:12:09.330 --> 00:12:12.130
That's when Tsubaki came to me.

00:12:12.330 --> 00:12:15.880
You could be someone far better!

00:12:16.080 --> 00:12:19.380
Use this to win your freedom!

00:12:19.630 --> 00:12:23.130
He gave me the SCM,
and I used it to enslave the old man...

00:12:23.670 --> 00:12:25.920
I enslaved Muon Nerima.

00:12:27.630 --> 00:12:30.080
But in the end, nothing changed.

00:12:30.380 --> 00:12:32.750
Nothing has gone the way I wanted it.

00:12:41.330 --> 00:12:42.670
Pardon our intrusion.

00:12:44.500 --> 00:12:46.210
You're Muon Nerima-san, correct?

00:12:51.210 --> 00:12:53.080
Please duel me.

00:12:53.290 --> 00:12:54.630
Who the fuck are you?!

00:12:54.630 --> 00:12:56.330
My name is Eia Arakawa.

00:12:56.540 --> 00:12:58.080
This is Zushiohmaru.

00:12:59.580 --> 00:13:03.710
Arakawa... Tsubaki said something
about a girl with a dog.

00:13:03.960 --> 00:13:07.080
You're a Master, right? Don't you have other Slaves?

00:13:07.580 --> 00:13:08.670
Yeah, so?

00:13:08.670 --> 00:13:11.960
Then why'd you stroll on in here with only your dog?

00:13:12.080 --> 00:13:14.830
You must have some confidence.

00:13:15.380 --> 00:13:17.080
How do you want to duel?

00:13:20.580 --> 00:13:22.830
The duel will be decided by earning money.

00:13:23.000 --> 00:13:24.380
Earning money?

00:13:24.500 --> 00:13:26.580
The time limit is two hours.

00:13:26.790 --> 00:13:29.670
The money you have on you now
and in your bank accounts doesn't count.

00:13:29.790 --> 00:13:32.750
You can't use a phone, a cellphone, or a computer.

00:13:33.670 --> 00:13:37.130
Whoever earns the most in two hours wins.

00:13:37.290 --> 00:13:40.210
Those rules favor me quite a bit, don't you think?

00:13:40.380 --> 00:13:43.710
I'm a man who owns multiple businesses.

00:13:44.040 --> 00:13:46.130
Yes, I know that.

00:13:46.460 --> 00:13:49.830
That's why I thought of a special duel
just for you, Nerima-san,

00:13:49.960 --> 00:13:52.330
so you'd be more inclined to accept.

00:13:52.330 --> 00:13:53.710
I see...

00:13:53.920 --> 00:13:56.130
Hey! Stop talking to her!

00:13:56.130 --> 00:13:57.580
I'm the Master here!

00:13:58.330 --> 00:13:59.790
Are you turning it down, then?

00:13:59.790 --> 00:14:01.830
The odds are completely in your favor.

00:14:02.920 --> 00:14:03.830
Like hell he's turning it down!

00:14:04.080 --> 00:14:05.750
C'mon, you're gonna do it!

00:14:07.330 --> 00:14:09.540
I understand the rules.

00:14:09.540 --> 00:14:12.330
Is it alright if I add one more?

00:14:12.750 --> 00:14:15.540
I want Minami to accompany you to keep watch.

00:14:15.710 --> 00:14:18.130
What?! Don't order me around!

00:14:18.330 --> 00:14:22.380
Alright, then may I have Zushi accompany you in return?

00:14:22.540 --> 00:14:23.670
The dog?

00:14:25.250 --> 00:14:26.880
I suppose I don't mind.

00:14:27.170 --> 00:14:30.670
Okay, then. The duel will start at 10 PM on the dot.

00:14:33.880 --> 00:14:35.880
Start earning money... now!

00:14:38.580 --> 00:14:40.130
Hey, wait!

00:14:40.380 --> 00:14:42.170
You called for us, Boss?

00:14:42.580 --> 00:14:45.750
Go collect the money from all of my shops.

00:14:46.040 --> 00:14:48.460
You can stick with the ones close by. Quickly, now.

00:14:48.460 --> 00:14:49.500
Yes, Sir!

00:14:53.500 --> 00:14:55.210
Let's see, now...

00:14:58.290 --> 00:15:00.210
Hey, where're you going?

00:15:04.130 --> 00:15:06.920
This isn't a phone, it's a listening device.

00:15:06.920 --> 00:15:08.830
It's not against the rules.

00:15:11.330 --> 00:15:12.750
Hey, wait!

00:15:13.880 --> 00:15:16.130
How the hell are you gonna get money?

00:15:24.290 --> 00:15:25.670
Okay...

00:15:27.290 --> 00:15:29.170
Hey, what're you doing?

00:15:29.880 --> 00:15:32.670
If you're going to earn money on the street,
this is how you do it.

00:15:32.830 --> 00:15:35.170
What? Do what? I don't get you!

00:15:37.790 --> 00:15:46.710
I want a heart that can laugh without lying...

00:15:46.710 --> 00:15:47.290
She's singing? Why all of a sudden?
I want a heart that can laugh without lying...

00:15:47.290 --> 00:15:49.000
I want a heart that can laugh without lying...

00:15:52.250 --> 00:15:53.290
But...

00:15:53.460 --> 00:15:58.250
She's getting people, and money...

00:15:59.500 --> 00:16:02.540
But she can't win against the Old Man
with this chump change!

00:16:06.170 --> 00:16:07.960
Thank you very much!

00:16:09.710 --> 00:16:10.500
Hey.

00:16:10.500 --> 00:16:12.250
That felt great!

00:16:12.250 --> 00:16:13.290
Huh?

00:16:13.460 --> 00:16:15.790
I'm so glad people came to listen.

00:16:15.790 --> 00:16:17.500
Hey! You're just fucking around, aren't...

00:16:20.380 --> 00:16:22.250
I was so moved by your song.

00:16:25.460 --> 00:16:27.170
Hey, you're...

00:16:27.750 --> 00:16:28.880
Thank you very much.

00:16:28.880 --> 00:16:31.330
Those are ten thousand yen notes!
That's five hundred thousand yen!

00:16:31.580 --> 00:16:35.330
No way... that rich girl was a fake!

00:16:35.710 --> 00:16:37.330
She's using her slaves!

00:16:37.540 --> 00:16:40.330
Hey, you staged that whole act, didn't you?

00:16:40.460 --> 00:16:42.210
It's not against the rules, is it?

00:16:44.040 --> 00:16:45.330
You're just messing with me...

00:16:48.170 --> 00:16:50.330
That's not going to be enough.

00:16:52.630 --> 00:16:53.790
Nerima, Sir!

00:16:53.790 --> 00:16:57.880
A new loan shark in the neighborhood
wanted to meet you...

00:16:58.500 --> 00:17:01.460
What? I don't have time for him right now-

00:17:01.460 --> 00:17:04.330
Wait, no, let him through.

00:17:05.460 --> 00:17:07.330
Futoda-san, right?

00:17:07.500 --> 00:17:10.290
Yes, it's good to meet you, Sir!

00:17:12.420 --> 00:17:14.130
What're you gonna do now, huh?

00:17:14.420 --> 00:17:15.880
Gonna run a gambling stand or something?

00:17:16.040 --> 00:17:18.130
Oh, right, I could do that, too.

00:17:18.540 --> 00:17:21.330
C'mon! You can't win
with just five hundred thousand yen!

00:17:21.580 --> 00:17:24.080
It's alright, I've got a plan.

00:17:29.380 --> 00:17:32.210
Then in exchange for an introduction,
you'll give me a loan.

00:17:32.210 --> 00:17:34.790
Yes, Sir! And, as a show of appreciation,

00:17:36.080 --> 00:17:38.040
I'll give you ten million yen, in cash!

00:17:38.460 --> 00:17:42.130
I'll just need you to sign this contract
and I'll hand it right over!

00:17:42.460 --> 00:17:46.460
Yes, excellent. I was just in need of some cash.

00:17:50.710 --> 00:17:51.960
Is this alright?

00:17:51.960 --> 00:17:53.830
Yes, I just needed your name...

00:17:55.750 --> 00:17:57.250
EIA ARAKAWA

00:18:01.500 --> 00:18:04.540
You're one of Eia-chan's little friends, aren't you?

00:18:09.250 --> 00:18:11.250
And where do you think you're going?

00:18:11.250 --> 00:18:12.750
Uh...

00:18:12.750 --> 00:18:17.500
Hey, stop! Ow! Ouch!

00:18:20.290 --> 00:18:24.790
Listen here, Futoda... No, Yuuga Ohta-kun.

00:18:25.290 --> 00:18:31.330
This contract you gave me is ridiculous.
Requiring me to return the money within 30 minutes?

00:18:32.080 --> 00:18:37.420
You were going to give me the money
then take it back to help Eia-chan win, isn't that right?

00:18:38.250 --> 00:18:40.540
Boss, we collected the money.

00:18:40.670 --> 00:18:44.040
There weren't many customers today,
so we've only got nine hundred thousand...

00:18:44.040 --> 00:18:46.290
Want us to go down to the other shops?

00:18:46.580 --> 00:18:48.330
No, it's alright.

00:18:48.960 --> 00:18:51.580
We've got more than enough.

00:18:56.290 --> 00:18:58.040
Welcome back, Eia-chan.

00:19:01.380 --> 00:19:03.460
Yuuga! Don't tell me...

00:19:03.460 --> 00:19:08.380
Thanks to him, I earned ten million yen,
plus an additional nine hundred thousand.

00:19:08.380 --> 00:19:09.830
How much did you earn?

00:19:13.670 --> 00:19:14.960
One million.

00:19:15.380 --> 00:19:19.290
Oh, so close, so close!
I can't believe you earned that much.

00:19:20.830 --> 00:19:22.670
Sadly, I've won.

00:19:22.670 --> 00:19:24.790
Too much scheming was your downfall, Little Miss.

00:19:25.000 --> 00:19:28.330
I wish you'd had a little more guts.

00:19:29.210 --> 00:19:30.750
Somethin' ain't right, Old Man!

00:19:30.960 --> 00:19:33.540
What? Am I being too smug about it?

00:19:33.710 --> 00:19:35.790
No! Look at the money!

00:19:41.670 --> 00:19:42.790
My ten million yen...!

00:19:43.000 --> 00:19:44.670
Hey, put it out!

00:19:47.920 --> 00:19:51.330
No good, Old Man, it's all burnt!

00:19:52.080 --> 00:19:54.330
You put a timed incendiary device in there...

00:19:55.460 --> 00:19:57.080
They must be fake...

00:19:57.580 --> 00:20:00.250
No, there's no way I wouldn't have noticed that!

00:20:00.460 --> 00:20:02.540
Nerima-san, where is your ten million yen?

00:20:02.830 --> 00:20:06.250
Don't tell me... it really was ten million yen?!

00:20:06.500 --> 00:20:08.170
Nobody could be that stupid.

00:20:08.750 --> 00:20:13.040
That's what I thought, until I met a certain idiot.

00:20:13.500 --> 00:20:14.880
This idiot right here.

00:20:17.580 --> 00:20:18.500
Wha...

00:20:21.880 --> 00:20:23.540
I can't believe it.

00:20:24.290 --> 00:20:25.540
Time's up.

00:20:25.830 --> 00:20:29.080
Nerima-san, you've earned
nine hundred thousand yen, correct?

00:20:29.830 --> 00:20:31.580
Yes, that's right.

00:20:32.130 --> 00:20:34.290
The end result is one million
against nine hundred thousand.

00:20:35.420 --> 00:20:36.710
I win.

00:20:42.040 --> 00:20:44.630
Alright, we did it! We won!

00:20:46.000 --> 00:20:48.420
But how did you earn that million?

00:20:48.750 --> 00:20:50.630
Sachi-san worked really hard for us...

00:20:50.830 --> 00:20:54.080
She asked her friends and her customers for donations.

00:20:54.290 --> 00:20:55.830
We were cutting it pretty close.

00:20:56.080 --> 00:21:00.920
So if we hadn't had that,
our ten million would've literally gone up in smoke?

00:21:01.210 --> 00:21:04.330
God dammit! What're you gonna do with us,
now that we're your slaves?!

00:21:04.580 --> 00:21:06.130
Did you go after gramps for his money?!

00:21:06.130 --> 00:21:06.920
No.

00:21:06.920 --> 00:21:07.750
What?

00:21:07.960 --> 00:21:10.170
We're going to free everyone from slavery.

00:21:10.170 --> 00:21:12.750
That's Eia's... That's our mission!

00:21:14.960 --> 00:21:18.460
We're going to duel everyone and destroy the SCMs.

00:21:18.460 --> 00:21:20.500
We'd like you to help us.

00:21:23.000 --> 00:21:24.630
Old Man...

00:21:26.710 --> 00:21:29.750
You're an interesting girl, Eia-chan! That's the stuff!

00:21:29.960 --> 00:21:35.290
You might be able to go up against... him.

00:21:38.040 --> 00:21:40.670
It's no use, I can't get through to them.

00:21:40.670 --> 00:21:42.670
Neither Fujiko nor Julia.

00:21:43.580 --> 00:21:47.040
I see. Alright. Continue to observe.

00:21:47.830 --> 00:21:49.170
Roger that.

00:21:54.420 --> 00:22:01.500
The number you have dialed is either out of service or is not powered on.

00:22:17.340 --> 00:22:20.920
